# Problem: video plays, commentary does not

**Observed:** 2026-10-09 on the VM Compose studio (`breadcast-studio`).
Configured server video is the NYC bike GoPro chunk from VAST S3
(`s3://team-36-vss-chunks/team-36/20261008_073129_GOPR0130_chunk_0018.mp4`).
Operator Start video shows the picture. There is no spoken commentary or
crew direction.

Compose container logs are almost empty (startup lines and S3 TLS warnings).
The useful evidence is `GET /api/status` with the operator token.

## What works

- S3 staging and red Start / Stop video playback
- ElevenLabs key present in Compose; speech provider reports
  `protocol=elevenlabs` and `ready=true`
- Program encoder writes frames; clip ends in holding

## What fails / stays inactive

| Surface | Last-run status |
|---|---|
| Direction roles (`director`, `commentator`, `speech`) | All `Inactive` |
| Direction reason | `Awaiting fresh mapped evidence` |
| Crew control | `crew_paused: true` (Take control still active) |
| Program commentary | `null` |
| VAST video analysis | `unavailable` — container missing `INGRESS_URL`, `USERNAME`, `PASSWORD`, `S3_CHUNKS_BUCKET` |
| YOLO / Cosmos / search | `Workshop endpoint is missing` |
| W&B LLM | Roles configured; `runtime model selection required` (no role model IDs) |
| Foundation jobs | `failed: 21` |

## Cause chain

```text
S3 video --> Start video --> picture OK
               |
               v
      mapped evidence?  NO (VAST/GPU not passed into the container)
               |
               v
      Release control?  NO (crew still paused)
               |
               v
      commentator text + ElevenLabs TTS  never run
```

ElevenLabs alone does not produce commentary. The commentator needs eligible
mapped evidence, crew proposals enabled (**Release control**), a selected W&B
commentator model, then TTS.

README already states that an archive summary alone does not enable live crew
decisions, and that current clocks/tracker state do not yet provide live
direction or synchronized commentary until perception and model wiring are
verified.

## Immediate operator steps (insufficient alone)

1. Prepare the event in Event details.
2. Start video.
3. Press the hand control → **Release control**.

## Required wiring to unblock evidence and models

Pass into Compose `.env` (gitignored) and run `./scripts/studio restart`:

- VAST: `INGRESS_URL`, `USERNAME`, `PASSWORD`, `S3_CHUNKS_BUCKET` (and related
  S3 vars already used for server-video staging)
- GPU: `COSMOS3_REASON_URL`, `YOLO_URL`, `COSMOS_EMBED1_URL` (and auth if needed)
- W&B role models: `BREADCAST_COMMENTATOR_MODEL`, `BREADCAST_DIRECTOR_MODEL`
  (plus `BREADCAST_SEGMENTOR_MODEL` for replays)
- Optional: `ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID` / event voice in Event details

## How to re-check

```sh
./scripts/studio logs --tail=100
# With operator token:
curl -sk -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" https://127.0.0.1:8080/api/status
```

Inspect `providers`, `direction`, `video_analysis`, `control.crew_paused`, and
`program.commentary`.
